        "notes": "Parts of the game are a little bleak, dark, and spooky. Some parts are designed to make players feel uneasy. Overall it is about a interest in weird modern art. The game is about toilets and everything they are related to so the jokes are toilet based. There is a certain amount of innuendo used throughout the game.\r\n"
